  "html": "<article id=\"post-4940\" class=\"container post-4940 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-uncategorized area-of-service-air-purifiers area-of-service-indoor-air-quality area-of-service-air-ducts\">\n<div class=\"breadcrumbs\">\n<a href=\"/about-us/blog\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outline\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronleft\" /></svg><span >Blog Posts</span>\n\n</a></div>\t<header class=\"entry-header\">\n\t\t<h1 class=\"entry-title has-secondary-color mt-3\">Indoor Air Quality Tips That Will Have You Breathing Easy This Fall</h1>\t\t\t<div class=\"entry-meta\">\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"posted-on p-sm\">Published on <span><time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2019-10-17T04:10:00+00:00\">October 17, 2019</time><time class=\"updated\" datetime=\"2025-04-12T01:08:14+00:00\">April 12, 2025</time></span></span>\t\t\t</div><!-- .entry-meta -->\n\t\t\t</header><!-- .entry-header -->\n\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"post-thumbnail\">\n\t\t\t\t<img width=\"1800\" height=\"1200\" src=\"/images/2024/02/indoor-air-quality-services.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"A photo of a living room with large windows in Durham, NC\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/images/2024/02/indoor-air-quality-services.jpg 1800w, /images/2024/02/indoor-air-quality-services-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/02/indoor-air-quality-services-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/02/indoor-air-quality-services-768x512.jpg 768w, /images/2024/02/indoor-air-quality-services-1536x1024.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1010px) 100vw, (max-width: 1440px) 50vw, 768px\" />\t\t\t</figure><!-- .post-thumbnail -->\n\n\t<div class=\"entry-content | asymmetric-container | mb-5\">\n\t\t<div class=\"asymmetric-main blog--main flow\">\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Indoor air quality isn’t something most home owners spend a lot of time thinking about, but it’s extremely important to your family’s health. Unfortunately, because it’s something you can’t see, increasing the quality of the air inside your Cary, North Carolina isn’t easy if you don’t know what you’re doing.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Happy Home Heating &amp; Cooling is here to help! Here are a few indoor air quality tips that will ensure your entire family can breathe easy all season long.</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Know the Right Way to Clean</h3>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br>Cleaning regularly is a great way to increase the air quality inside your home, especially in the fall. Dusting and vacuuming are great ways to banish dust and debris from your home. However, how you clean matters.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You should always clean your home from top to bottom. That way, any dust you stir up when cleaning the tops of the bookcases can be vacuumed out of the carpet when you’re almost done cleaning.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">How you dust matters too! It’s much better to use a damp rag to wipe surfaces, because it traps all the particles instead of making them airborne, like traditional dusters do.</p>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Use a Humidifier</h3>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br>It isn’t just the cleanliness of the air you have to think about when it comes to indoor air quality . In the fall, the air starts to dry out. Combined with the fact that your heater will start kicking on more frequently, and it’s easy to see how your air quality could be negatively affected.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">An easy solution is to use a humidifier. It can send moisture into the air and prevent a wide variety of dry air problems that include:</p>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Dry eyes</li>\n\n<li>Irritated sinuses</li>\n\n<li>Nosebleeds</li>\n\n<li>Dry skin</li>\n\n<li>Static cling</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Clean Your Air Ducts</h3>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><br>No matter how much you do yourself to positively affect the air quality in your home this fall, you can only do so much. That’s because dirt and debris can settle in your HVAC system, then it all ends up getting blown throughout your home every time the system kicks on.</p>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Contact Happy Home Heating &amp; Cooling, and we can help! We would be happy to provide you with air duct cleaning services that will leave your home clean and fresh. We can also talk about our air purification systems, if you are looking for a more permanent solution to your indoor air quality problems. Give us a call or fill out our online form to discuss all your options today!</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"asymmetric-side blog--sidebar\">\n\t\t\t<div  class=\"card card--post has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Have a question?\" aria-label=\"Have a question?\">Have a question?</p>\n\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\"><div class=\"flow\"><p>Let’s connect and have a quick conversation to see how we can help.</p>\n<a href=\"tel:+13362819025\" aria-label=\"Call now: +13362819025\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outline\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta phone-link\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span data-show-on=\"desktop\">(336) 281-9025</span>\n        <span data-show-on=\"mobile\">Call Now</span>\n</a></div></div>\n\n                </div></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div><!-- .entry-content -->\n    <footer class=\"entry-footer container has-gray-light-background-color has-background py-5\">\n        <div>\n\t<h3 class=\"h2\">Recommended Reads:</h3>\n\t<a hr